      "text": "### Playwright Trace: Dispute\n\nFailure observed at /customer/disputes: POST /customer/disputes -> 201 SUCCESS trên đơn awaiting_payment\n\n- Route: /customer/disputes\n- Error: N/A\n- Request: POST /customer/disputes -> 201 SUCCESS trên đơn awaiting_payment",
      "x": 2900,
